extra_words.txt is the reviewed local lexical supplement, also dedicated
under CC0-1.0. ประเทศไทย is included because it is absent from the pinned
list; matching code contains no lexical special cases.

Regenerate offline from the repository root:
python scripts/generate_thai_dictionary.py --input lib/ThaiText/dictionary/words_th.txt --extra lib/ThaiText/dictionary/extra_words.txt --output lib/ThaiText/generated/ThaiDictionaryData.h --report lib/ThaiText/dictionary/report.json

The generator keeps unique all-Thai U+0E01..U+0E5B entries, without stripping
suffix marks or normalizing text. The data CRC covers compressed bytes then
little-endian uint32 block offsets (including the terminal offset). The JSON
report records exact payload/index flash bytes; compiler/linker placement and
scalar constants are not a claim about total firmware growth.
